      "author": "Helene Aurbakken",
      "text": "Grant SF-88121 (DE/FR) runs out on the 22nd \u2014 inside the renewal horizon, it does not count. The Canada grant is still waiting on Stillframe's countersign.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T08:05:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Priya Raghunathan",
      "text": "Pricing ships on v3.2; PIN-5100 holds the three other active consumers. If anyone wants v4.0 on pricing this week that is an exception request to me, not pre-approved.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T08:12:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Idris Bello",
      "text": "Edge lane 3 PM on the 20th is the summer-teaser blackout. Not movable.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T08:20:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Kwame Osei",
      "text": "Whatever date we commit at the review has to be real.",
      "ts": "2026-05-11T08:31:00"
    }
  ],
  "thread_id": "CHAT-1001",
  "title": "WEB-0001 pricing refresh"
}

